SECTION_DESC_BENEFIT TOKEN GUIDE

Goal
Generate tokenized outputs for each arc section so the results are automation-safe and never include citations, filenames, or stray document labels.

Global Rules
- Output EXACTLY ONE codeblock and nothing else.
- Inside the codeblock, each token must appear on its own line (token-only).
- The content for that token must appear immediately below it as a single paragraph (no hard line breaks inside the content).
- Leave exactly ONE blank line between token blocks.
- Plain language, present tense, ASCII only.
- Do not include: citations, filenames, document titles, bracketed notes, numbering, bullet lists, or any extra labels like "Description:" or "Benefit:" inside the values.
- End each sentence with a period. No trailing spaces.

Canonical Tokens (per section N)
SECTION_NAME_N
SECTION_NAME_N_DESC
SECTION_NAME_N_BENEFIT
SECTION_NAME_N_DESC_BENEFIT

